# fixtures/hex/chain/wrong-position/log.1.hex: store C ([F05 §5.2] check 5, [72 M1]). After the epoch-start group,
# the group that creates main and commit c1's group, the bytes at the next boundary p are a record of this epoch
# with a valid record checksum whose lsn field says p + 64: a record an earlier write of the same epoch left at
# another position. The group is invalid; p is at or above durable_lsn, so p is the end of the valid log
# ([F05 §5.3]). HEAD.hex: committed_lsn = durable_lsn = p.

